## Task

Implement the TODO functions in the AI Model Operator controller.

**File**: `operators/ai-model-operator/controllers/aimodel_controller.go`

### 1. Implement `checkS3ArtifactExists` (line 472-482)

Current placeholder always returns nil. Need to:
- Add AWS SDK v2 dependency to go.mod
- Perform S3 HEAD request to check if model exists
- Return error if artifact is missing

```go
func (r *AIModelReconciler) checkS3ArtifactExists(ctx context.Context, aiModel *aimodelv1alpha1.AIModel) error {
    cfg, err := config.LoadDefaultConfig(ctx)
    if err != nil {
        return fmt.Errorf("failed to load AWS config: %w", err)
    }

    client := s3.NewFromConfig(cfg)
    _, err = client.HeadObject(ctx, &s3.HeadObjectInput{
        Bucket: aws.String(aiModel.Spec.S3Bucket),
        Key:    aws.String(aiModel.Spec.S3Key),
    })
    if err != nil {
        var notFound *types.NotFound
        if errors.As(err, &notFound) {
            return fmt.Errorf("artifact not found in S3: s3://%s/%s", aiModel.Spec.S3Bucket, aiModel.Spec.S3Key)
        }
        return fmt.Errorf("failed to check S3 artifact: %w", err)
    }
    return nil
}
```

### 2. Implement `finalizeAIModel` (line 341-350)

Current placeholder does nothing. Need to:
- Delete owned resources explicitly (belt and suspenders with OwnerReferences)
- Clean up any external resources if needed

```go
func (r *AIModelReconciler) finalizeAIModel(ctx context.Context, aiModel *aimodelv1alpha1.AIModel) error {
    log := log.FromContext(ctx)

    // Delete Deployment
    dep := &appsv1.Deployment{}
    if err := r.Get(ctx, client.ObjectKey{Name: fmt.Sprintf("%s-vllm", aiModel.Name), Namespace: aiModel.Namespace}, dep); err == nil {
        if err := r.Delete(ctx, dep); err != nil {
            log.Error(err, "Failed to delete Deployment")
        }
    }

    // Delete Service
    svc := &corev1.Service{}
    if err := r.Get(ctx, client.ObjectKey{Name: fmt.Sprintf("%s-vllm-svc", aiModel.Name), Namespace: aiModel.Namespace}, svc); err == nil {
        if err := r.Delete(ctx, svc); err != nil {
            log.Error(err, "Failed to delete Service")
        }
    }

    // Delete Job
    job := &batchv1.Job{}
    if err := r.Get(ctx, client.ObjectKey{Name: fmt.Sprintf("%s-downloader", aiModel.Name), Namespace: aiModel.Namespace}, job); err == nil {
        if err := r.Delete(ctx, job); err != nil {
            log.Error(err, "Failed to delete Job")
        }
    }

    log.Info("Successfully finalized AIModel", "name", aiModel.Name)
    return nil
}
```

### Dependencies to Add

```
go get github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2
go get github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/config
go get github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/s3
```

### Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] `checkS3ArtifactExists` performs actual S3 HEAD request
- [ ] `finalizeAIModel` cleans up all owned resources
- [ ] AWS SDK v2 added to go.mod
- [ ] Unit tests cover both functions

